OL,5,G1300 Warbird Workshop
OL,6,     FL39 Jet: At St Athan in Wales,
OL,7,     Fengineer John Sparks and his team
OL,8,     Fof ex-Navy and RAF engineers begin
OL,9,     Fthe task of reassembling the
OL,10,     FCzech-built jet from nine parts
OL,11,     Fdelivered by lorry.
OL,12,G1400 Warbird Workshop
OL,13,     FHurricane: With no plans to guide
OL,14,     Fthem, an elite team of expert
OL,15,     Fengineers re-create a unique
OL,16,     Ftwo-seater version of the
OL,17,     Flegendary Hawker Hurricane
OL,18,     Ffighter.
