OL,13,     FWe Shall Fight Them In The
OL,14,     FStreets: The physical defence of
OL,15,     FLondon was crucial. A ring of
OL,16,     Fsteel and concrete was thrown up
OL,17,     Faround the capital as well as
OL,18,     Futilising natural defences.
